// ============================================
// CARD TYPE REFERENCE
// ============================================
//
// ENTITY CARD:
//   - Has front/back flip in popup
//   - Front: icon, name, quickStats grid, sentiment badge
//   - Back: key signal quote, detail rows, analysis note
//   - Thumbnail: gradient header, icon, name, sentiment
//   - Use for: Companies, competitors, specific organizations
//
// MEMO:
//   - Single-sided popup (no flip)
//   - Has FROM/RE header, classification badge
//   - Sections with headings, prose, and lists
//   - Thumbnail: document icon, "INTERNAL" label, from name
//   - Use for: Internal Microsoft communications, team reports,
//     leadership assessments, post-mortems
//
// BRIEFING:
//   - Single-sided popup (no flip)
//   - Hero stat at top (large number + label)
//   - Structured sections with mixed content (prose, stats, lists)
//   - Thumbnail: chart icon, "REPORT" label, key number
//   - Use for: Market reports, trend analysis, developer surveys,
//     financial data, external research
//
// ============================================
// GRID LAYOUT LOGIC
// ============================================
//
// 4 cards or fewer: 2x2 grid, all equal size
// 5 cards: 2x2 grid for primary 4 + 1 full-width secondary below
// 6+ cards: 2x2 grid for top 4 + "More Intel (N)" expand button
//           that reveals remaining cards
//
// Card type determines thumbnail appearance:
//   - entity: gradient header strip + icon + sentiment tag
//   - memo: solid muted header + document icon + FROM name
//   - briefing: solid accent header + chart icon + hero number
//
// ============================================